comments.text:
@dylan_curious, that interview was wild. If we really have "two years left", then digging holes in the ground won't save anyone. Bunkers seem pretty useless at that point. The only preparation that actually works is spiritual.

It was hard to listen to Yampolskiy call people "parasites" just because they can't help a computer. That is a hopeless way to look at life. But I loved your idea about an "unlock code". The Bible actually offers this, a totally different "source code". It reveals that we aren't accidents. We were created with value. The "Logos" or reasoning behind this unexpected miracle is explained in the Gospel of John. It fills in the gap to the actual real world. 

To a super-computer we might be nothing, but to God, we are everything! I challenge you to read the book of John. It connects the dots in a way AI never could.
